const NAV=[['overview','风险总览','home'],['market','市场与行业','chart'],['watchlist','我的自选','folder'],['research','个股七维分析','nodes'],['sentiment','市场情绪偏离','clock'],['valuation','估值与基本面','shield'],['factors','多因子筛选','settings'],['backtest','笑哭脸回测','smile'],['review','研究复盘','plan'],['data','数据与方法','folder']];
const E=RiskEngine,byCode=c=>CATALOG.find(a=>a.code===c);
let uploaded=null,mode='demo';try{const s=localStorage.getItem('risklens-v2-snapshot');if(s)uploaded=E.validateSnapshot(JSON.parse(s));mode=localStorage.getItem('risklens-v2-mode')||'demo'}catch{}
const state={page:'overview',code:'002281',dimension:0,query:'',filter:'all',market:'bench',metric:'ret20',btTab:'equity',weights:[1,1,1,1,1,1]};
const bt={capital:1000000,position:50,fee:8,slip:5,lot:100,execution:'open',limit:3,start:'2026-07-27',end:'2026-10-29',enhanced:false,marketGate:false,wyckoff:false};
function syncThemeControl(){const theme=RiskUserState.validTheme(document.documentElement.dataset.theme),select=document.querySelector('#theme-select'),meta=document.querySelector('meta[name="theme-color"]');if(select)select.value=theme;if(meta)meta.setAttribute('content',theme==='polymarket'?'#161f2c':'#087f74')}
function setWebsiteTheme(value,remember=true){const theme=RiskUserState.validTheme(value);let saved=true;if(remember){try{RiskUserState.saveTheme(theme)}catch{saved=false}}document.documentElement.dataset.theme=theme;render();if(remember)toast((theme==='polymarket'?'已切换 Polymarket 深色':'已切换明亮风格')+(saved?'':'；当前浏览器无法保存偏好'))}
const data=()=>mode==='local'?(localSnapshot||{data_kind:'local',instruments:{}}):mode==='demo'?E.demo:uploaded||{data_kind:'uploaded',instruments:{}};
const obs=c=>data().instruments[c]||null,series=(c,options={})=>E.series(data(),c,{includeLive:true,...options}),asset=()=>byCode(state.code),isDemo=()=>mode==='demo';
const num=(v,d=2)=>E.valid(v)?new Intl.NumberFormat('zh-CN',{maximumFractionDigits:d,minimumFractionDigits:d}).format(v):'—';
const currency=(v,d=0)=>num(v,d),money=v=>E.valid(v)?new Intl.NumberFormat('zh-CN',{style:'currency',currency:state.page==='backtest'?(byCode(state.code)?.currency||'CNY'):'CNY',maximumFractionDigits:0}).format(v):'—',change=v=>E.valid(v)?(v>0?'+':'')+num(v)+'%':'—',cls=v=>!E.valid(v)?'muted':v>=0?'positive':'negative';
const esc=x=>String(x??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
function pill(t,c='neutral'){return `<span class="pill ${c}">${t}</span>`}
function button(t,action,primary=false,ico=''){return `<button class="btn ${primary?'primary':''}" onclick="${action}">${ico?icon(ico):''}${t}</button>`}
function title(t,sub,actions=''){return `<div class="page-head"><div><h1>${t}</h1><p>${sub}</p></div><div class="head-actions">${actions}</div></div>`}
function panel(t,body,aside='',klass=''){return `<section class="panel ${klass}"><div class="panel-head"><h2>${t}</h2>${aside}</div>${body}</section>`}
function metric(t,v,sub){return `<div class="metric"><div class="metric-label">${t}</div><div class="metric-value num">${v}</div><div class="metric-foot">${sub}</div></div>`}
function notice(t,c='info'){return `<div class="notice ${c}">${icon('info')}<span>${t}</span></div>`}
function face(s){return s?`<span class="face ${s.type==='buy'?'teal':'red'}">${s.type==='buy'?icon('smile'):'<svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8 9h.1M16 9h.1M8 17q4-6 8 0"/></svg>'}${s.provisional?'盘中·':''}${s.filtered?'已过滤':s.type==='buy'?s.grade+'级笑脸':s.grade==='strong'?'强哭脸':'哭脸'}</span>`:'<span class="small muted">无确认信号</span>'}
function sourceLine(c){const r=obs(c);return `<span class="small muted">${isDemo()?'合成示例':esc(r?.source||(mode==='local'?'等待本地行情':'待导入'))} · ${esc(r?.as_of||'日期待补齐')}${r&&!r.completed?' · 盘中未确认':''}</span>`}
function selectAsset(id='asset-select',all=false){return `<select id="${id}" aria-label="选择研究标的" onchange="setAsset(this.value)">${(all?CATALOG.filter(a=>a.watch||a.benchmark):[...new Set([...WATCH_CODES,state.code])].map(byCode)).map(a=>`<option value="${a.code}" ${a.code===state.code?'selected':''}>${esc(a.name)} · ${esc(a.symbol||a.code)}${a.market&&a.market!=='CN'?' / '+a.market:''}</option>`).join('')}</select>`}
function spark(vals,color='#087f74'){if(vals.length<2)return '<span class="muted small">待导入</span>';const lo=Math.min(...vals),range=Math.max(...vals)-lo||1;return `<svg class="inline-spark" viewBox="0 0 120 38" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="${vals.map((v,i)=>`${2+i/(vals.length-1)*116},${34-(v-lo)/range*30}`).join(' ')}" fill="none" stroke="${color}" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg>`}
function renderShell(){$('#sidebar').innerHTML=`<div class="brand"><svg class="brand-mark" viewBox="0 0 40 44" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 1 38 11v9L20 10 9 16v12l11 6 8-4v-7l-8 4v-9l18-9v26L20 44 2 34V11Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg><div><div class="brand-name">观澜</div><div class="brand-sub">RISK LENS</div></div></div><div class="nav-label">市场观察 · 个股研究</div><nav aria-label="主要导航">${NAV.map(([id,t,ico])=>`<button class="nav-item ${state.page===id?'active':''}" ${state.page===id?'aria-current="page"':''} onclick="go('${id}')">${icon(ico)}${t}</button>`).join('')}</nav><div class="sidebar-bottom"><div class="small teal"><i class="mini-dot"></i>研究工作台 v0.9.0</div><p>6类ETF · ${WATCH_CODES.length}个自选 · 4个技能</p><button class="text-button" style="margin-top:10px" onclick="go('data')">数据来源与方法 ${icon('arrow')}</button></div>`;$('#crumb').textContent=NAV.find(n=>n[0]===state.page)?.[1]||'研究总览';$('#search-icon').innerHTML=icon('search');$('#data-status').innerHTML=`<i></i>${mode==='local'?(localStatus?.busy?'真实行情刷新中':'行情快照 · '+(localStatus?.as_of||'连接中')):isDemo()?'合成演示数据':uploaded?'已导入快照':'待导入数据'}`;$('#mode-toggle').textContent=hasLocalServer?(mode==='local'?'切换演示模式':'返回真实行情'):isDemo()?'切换快照模式':'返回演示模式';$('#local-refresh').hidden=!hasLocalServer;$('#local-refresh').disabled=!!localStatus?.busy;syncThemeControl()}
function researchHref(code){return '#research/'+encodeURIComponent(code)}
function backtestHref(code){return '#backtest/'+encodeURIComponent(code)}
function isAssetRoute(page){return ['research','backtest','valuation','sentiment'].includes(page)}
function assetPageHref(page,code){return '#'+page+'/'+encodeURIComponent(code)}
function parseAppRoute(hash){
 const raw=String(hash||'').replace(/^#/,''),parts=raw.split('/'),legacy=parts[0]==='wyckoff',page=legacy?'backtest':parts[0]||'overview';
 if(!NAV.some(n=>n[0]===page))return {page:'overview'};
 if(!isAssetRoute(page))return {page};
 if(parts.length===1)return {page,code:null,legacy};
 try{const code=decodeURIComponent(parts[1]).toUpperCase();return parts.length===2&&/^[A-Z0-9][A-Z0-9.-]{0,31}$/.test(code)?{page,code,legacy}:{page,error:true}}catch{return {page,error:true}}
}
function configureAsset(code){
 state.code=code;bt.lot=(byCode(code).market||'CN')==='CN'?100:1;
 if((byCode(code).market||'CN')!=='CN')bt.marketGate=false;
}
function applyHashRoute(){
 const route=parseAppRoute(location.hash);state.page=route.page;state.researchRouteError=!!route.error;
 state.researchRouteCode=isAssetRoute(route.page)?route.code||(!route.error?state.code:null):null;
 if(state.researchRouteCode&&byCode(state.researchRouteCode))configureAsset(state.researchRouteCode);
 if(route.legacy)writeAppRoute(true);
 state.dimension=0;document.body.classList.remove('menu-open');
}
function resolveResearchRoute(){
 if(isAssetRoute(state.page)&&state.researchRouteCode&&byCode(state.researchRouteCode)&&state.code!==state.researchRouteCode)configureAsset(state.researchRouteCode);
}
function researchRouteUnavailable(){return isAssetRoute(state.page)&&(state.researchRouteError||state.researchRouteCode&&!byCode(state.researchRouteCode))}
function unavailableResearchPage(){return title(NAV.find(n=>n[0]===state.page)?.[1]||'个股研究','按链接中的证券代码定位，数据以当前研究目录为准。')+notice(state.researchRouteError?'证券链接格式无效，请从自选标的重新进入。':`证券 ${esc(state.researchRouteCode)} 尚未载入当前目录。${hasLocalServer&&!localSnapshot&&!localStatus?.errors?.connection?'正在连接本地数据，载入目录后自动定位。':'请先在我的自选中搜索并添加该证券，再打开此链接。'}`)+button('返回我的自选',"go('watchlist')",true)}
function writeAppRoute(replace=false){
 const hash=isAssetRoute(state.page)?assetPageHref(state.page,state.researchRouteCode||state.code):'#'+state.page;
 if(location.hash!==hash)history[replace?'replaceState':'pushState'](null,'',hash);
}
function go(page){
 if(!NAV.some(n=>n[0]===page))return;
 state.page=page;state.researchRouteError=false;state.researchRouteCode=isAssetRoute(page)?state.code:null;
 document.body.classList.remove('menu-open');writeAppRoute();render();window.scrollTo(0,0);
}
function setAsset(code,page){
 if(!byCode(code))return toast('证券不在当前目录');
 configureAsset(code);state.dimension=0;if(page)state.page=page;
 state.researchRouteError=false;state.researchRouteCode=isAssetRoute(state.page)?code:null;
 writeAppRoute();render();window.scrollTo(0,0);
}
function toast(t){$('#toast').textContent=t;$('#toast').classList.add('show');clearTimeout(window.toastTimeout);window.toastTimeout=setTimeout(()=>$('#toast').classList.remove('show'),3000)}
function switchMode(){mode=hasLocalServer?(mode==='local'?'demo':'local'):isDemo()?'uploaded':'demo';try{localStorage.setItem('risklens-v2-mode',mode)}catch{}render();toast(mode==='local'?'使用本地真实行情；未接入字段留空':isDemo()?'当前为合成数据交互演示':uploaded?'当前使用导入快照':'未导入数据，相关数值保持空缺')}
function modal(t,body){delete $('#dialog').dataset.kind;$('#dialog').setAttribute('aria-label',t);$('#dialog').innerHTML=`<div class="dialog-head"><h2>${t}</h2><button class="icon-button" aria-label="关闭对话框" onclick="$('#dialog').close()">${icon('close')}</button></div><div class="dialog-body">${body}</div>`;$('#dialog').showModal()}
function banner(){if(mode==='local')return `<div class="data-ribbon live-data"><span><strong>${localStatus?.errors?.['A股初始报价']||localStatus?.errors?.['A股二次报价']||localStatus?.errors?.provider?'真实行情 · A股报价更新失败':'真实行情'}</strong> · 快照 ${esc(localSnapshot?.fetched_at?.replace('T',' ').replace('+08:00','')||'待连接')} 北京时间 · 盘中K线与信号明确标记${localStatus?.busy?' · '+esc(localStatus.stage||'抓取中')+' '+localStatus.done+'/'+(localStatus.total||CATALOG.filter(a=>a.watch||a.benchmark).length):''}${Object.keys(localStatus?.errors||{}).length?' · 失败数据保留上次可用记录':''}${localStatus?.cache_warning?(localStatus.cache_persisted?' · 已切换备用缓存目录':' · 缓存不可写，行情保留在内存'):''}</span><button onclick="go('data')">连接详情 ${icon('arrow')}</button></div>`;return `<div class="data-ribbon"><span>${isDemo()?'<strong>合成演示</strong> · 行情、财务、排名和绩效均非实际市场结论':'<strong>快照研究</strong> · 仅使用已导入数据，缺失保持为空'}</span><button onclick="go('data')">数据覆盖与方法 ${icon('arrow')}</button></div>`}
function latestSignal(c){return E.signals(series(c)).filter(x=>!x.filtered).at(-1)||null}
function trend(m){return !m?.ma60?{text:'样本不足',type:'neutral'}:m.price>m.ma20&&m.price>m.ma60?{text:'趋势偏强',type:'good'}:m.price<m.ma20&&m.price<m.ma60?{text:'趋势偏弱',type:'warn'}:{text:'趋势分歧',type:'neutral'}}
function strip(){return `<div class="market-strip six">${BENCH_CODES.map(c=>{const a=byCode(c),m=E.metrics(series(c));return `<button class="market-tile" onclick="setAsset('${c}','market')"><div><strong>${a.shortName}</strong><div class="value num ${cls(m?.change)}">${m?num(m.price,3):'—'} <span>${change(m?.change)}</span></div></div></button>`}).join('')}</div>`}
function watchTable(list=WATCH_CODES.map(byCode)){return `<div class="table-wrap watch-table-wrap"><table class="watch-table"><thead><tr>${watchSortHeader('name','自选标的','按证券名称排序')}${watchSortHeader('industry','行业 / 类型')}${watchSortHeader('price',mode==='local'?'最新价 / 状态':isDemo()?'合成价格':'快照价格','按原币种价格数值排序，不换汇')}${watchSortHeader('change','日涨跌')}${watchSortHeader('ret5','5日表现')}${watchSortHeader('ret20','20日表现')}${watchSortHeader('ret60','60日表现','需61条有效日线，缺失置后')}${watchSortHeader('ret220','220日表现','需221条有效日线，缺失置后')}${WATCH_FLOW_WINDOWS.map(n=>watchSortHeader('flow'+n,(n===1?'当日':n+'日')+'净流入','股票为超大单+大单净额，ETF为净申赎估算；各自截至资金日期')).join('')}${watchSortHeader('trend','趋势','升序：偏弱、分歧、偏强；样本不足置后')}${watchSortHeader('signal','最近研究信号','按最近信号日期排序，无信号置后')}${watchSortHeader('samples','样本 / 数据时间')}<th scope="col" class="watch-research-column">研究</th><th>管理</th></tr></thead><tbody>${sortWatchRows(list).map(a=>{const b=series(a.code),m=E.metrics(b),s=latestSignal(a.code),t=trend(m);return `<tr><td><button class="stock-link" onclick="setAsset('${a.code}','research')"><span class="stock-name">${esc(a.name)}</span><span class="stock-code">${esc(a.symbol||a.code)}</span></button></td><td class="muted">${esc(a.industry)}<div class="table-sub">${({CN:"A股",HK:"港股",US:"美股"})[a.market||"CN"]} / ${esc(a.currency||"CNY")}</div></td><td class="num">${num(m?.price,m?.price<10?3:2)}<div class="table-sub">${!b.length?'等待行情':b.at(-1)?.completed===false?'盘中未确认':'收盘'} ${obs(a.code)?.latest_quote?.timestamp?.slice(11,19)||''}</div></td><td class="num ${cls(m?.change)}">${change(m?.change)}</td><td class="num ${cls(m?.ret5)}">${change(m?.ret5)}</td><td class="num ${cls(m?.ret20)}">${change(m?.ret20)}</td><td class="num watch-performance ${cls(m?.ret60)}">${change(m?.ret60)}${!E.valid(m?.ret60)?'<div class="table-sub">历史不足61条</div>':''}</td><td class="num watch-performance ${cls(m?.ret220)}">${change(m?.ret220)}${!E.valid(m?.ret220)?'<div class="table-sub">历史不足221条</div>':''}</td>${watchFlowCells(a)}<td>${pill(t.text,t.type)}</td><td>${face(s)}<div class="table-sub">${s?s.date:'—'}</div></td><td>${watchJobText(a.code)}${b.length}条${a.shortHistory?' · 短样本':''}<div class="table-sub">${obs(a.code)?.as_of||'待导入'}</div></td><td class="watch-research-column"><div class="watch-research-links"><a class="watch-study-link" href="${esc(assetPageHref('research',a.code))}" aria-label="${esc(a.name)} · 查看七维分析">七维分析</a><a class="watch-study-link" href="${esc(assetPageHref('valuation',a.code))}" aria-label="${esc(a.name)} · 查看估值与基本面">基本面</a><a class="watch-study-link" href="${esc(assetPageHref('sentiment',a.code))}" aria-label="${esc(a.name)} · 查看市场情绪偏离">情绪面</a><a class="watch-study-link" href="${esc(assetPageHref('backtest',a.code))}" aria-label="${esc(a.name)} · 查看回测">回测</a></div></td>${watchManagementCell(a)}</tr>`}).join('')||'<tr><td colspan="19" class="empty">没有匹配标的。</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div><div class="watch-period-note">点击表头切换升序 / 降序；缺失值始终置后，同值保持原顺序。5日、20日、60日、220日表现按有效日频间隔计算：末值 ÷ 对应间隔前的价格 − 1；分别需要6 / 21 / 61 / 221条日线。停牌与节假日不插值；盘中末根随刷新变化，价格涨跌不含分红再投资。股票资金净流入采用超大单+大单净额；沪市ETF采用清算后份额变化×前一交易日单位净值的净申赎估算，点击「逐日明细」查看来源；当日指各标的行情日期，近N日为截至最新可用资金日的N条记录。行情日资金尚未返回时，当日显示—，另标最近可用日及该日净额；窗口内有缺失的累计值显示—；股票与ETF金额口径不同，排序仅比较数值；其他市场未有可核验数据时保持空缺。金额为原币种，未换汇。</div>`}
function overview(){const ms=BENCH_CODES.map(c=>E.metrics(series(c))),known=ms.filter(m=>m?.ma10),weak=known.filter(m=>m.price<m.ma10).length,count=WATCH_CODES.filter(c=>series(c).length).length;return strip()+title('研究总览','从市场环境出发，逐层验证个股判断。',button('导入研究快照',"go('data')",false,'folder'))+`<div class="metrics">${metric('市场观察池','6类ETF','大盘 / 中盘 / 小盘 / 成长 / 科创')}${metric('我的自选','8个标的','6只股票 + 2只ETF')}${metric('低于MA10',known.length?weak+' / '+known.length:'—','ETF趋势分布，非全A市场宽度')}${metric('数据覆盖',count+' / 8',mode==='local'?'真实收盘样本，缺失不补':isDemo()?'全部为合成样本':'按已导入快照统计')}</div><div class="grid-main">${panel('六ETF · 区间相对表现',`<div class="panel-body performance-bars">${BENCH_CODES.map(c=>{const a=byCode(c),m=E.metrics(series(c)),v=m?.[state.metric],width=E.valid(v)?Math.min(48,Math.abs(v)*2):0;return `<button class="performance-row" onclick="setAsset('${c}','market')"><div><strong>${a.shortName}</strong><small>${c} · ${a.manager}</small></div><div class="center-bar"><i style="width:${width}%;left:${v>=0?50:50-width}%;background:${v>=0?'#df776f':'#55a293'}"></i></div><span class="num ${cls(v)}">${change(v)}</span></button>`}).join('')}</div><div class="panel-note">ETF作为对应指数的观察代理，含跟踪误差；${isDemo()?'合成表现不用于市场判断。':'观察收益不等同未来表现。'}</div>`,`<div class="segmented">${[['ret20','近20日'],['ret120','近120日']].map(([id,t])=>`<button class="${state.metric===id?'active':''}" onclick="state.metric='${id}';render()">${t}</button>`).join('')}</div>`)}${panel('研究优先事项',`<button class="alert-row" onclick="setAsset('688825','factors')"><span class="alert-mark"></span><div class="alert-content"><strong>长鑫科技 · 处理短历史</strong><p>长期动量、年波动和两年Beta不足时不补造。</p>${pill('样本约束','warn')}</div></button><button class="alert-row" onclick="go('sentiment')"><span class="alert-mark" style="background:var(--teal)"></span><div class="alert-content"><strong>价格下跌 ≠ 基本面被错杀</strong><p>先排除结构性问题，再记录催化剂和反证。</p>${pill('情绪偏离','good')}</div></button><button class="alert-row" onclick="go('factors')"><span class="alert-mark"></span><div class="alert-content"><strong>多因子 · 统一比较口径</strong><p>仅在六只自选股票内比较，ETF独立分析。</p>${pill('截面研究')}</div></button>`)}</div>${panel('我的自选',watchTable(),button('查看全部',"go('watchlist')"))}<div class="section-heading" style="margin-top:24px"><h2>四个技能，串联研究流程</h2></div><div class="skill-grid">${SKILL_MAP.map((s,i)=>`<button class="skill-tile" onclick="go('${['sentiment','valuation','factors','backtest'][i]}')"><span class="skill-index">0${i+1}</span><h3>${s.name}</h3><p>${s.detail}</p><span class="text-button">进入模块 ${icon('arrow')}</span></button>`).join('')}</div>`}
function market(){const selected=BENCH_CODES.includes(state.code)?state.code:'588080',a=byCode(selected),b=series(selected),m=E.metrics(b);return title('市场与行业','六类ETF看市场结构，外围事件看产业传导。',pill('ETF代理 ≠ 指数本身'))+`<div class="filter-tabs panel-space">${[['bench','六ETF监控'],['external','外围与产业链'],['flow','资金与数据口径']].map(([id,t])=>`<button class="filter-chip ${state.market===id?'active':''}" onclick="state.market='${id}';render()">${t}</button>`).join('')}</div>${state.market==='external'?externalMarket():state.market==='flow'?flowMarket():`<div class="etf-grid">${BENCH_CODES.map(c=>{const a=byCode(c),b=series(c),m=E.metrics(b),t=trend(m);return `<button class="etf-tile ${c===selected?'selected':''}" onclick="setAsset('${c}')"><div class="etf-title"><strong>${a.shortName}</strong>${pill(t.text,t.type)}</div><div class="table-sub">${c} · ${a.manager} · ${a.industry}</div><div class="etf-price num">${num(m?.price,3)} <small class="${cls(m?.change)}">${change(m?.change)}</small></div>${spark(b.slice(-40).map(x=>x.close))}<div class="etf-foot"><span>20日 ${change(m?.ret20)}</span><span>60日回撤 ${change(m?.drawdown)}</span></div></button>`}).join('')}</div><div class="grid-main">${panel(a.name+' · 趋势观察',b.length?`<div class="legend"><span><i></i>${isDemo()?'合成价格':'导入收盘价'}</span><span>${obs(selected).as_of}</span></div><div class="chart-wrap">${lineChart(b.slice(-80).map(x=>x.close),{height:270,labels:[b.at(-Math.min(80,b.length)).date.slice(5),b.at(-1).date.slice(5)]})}</div>`:'<div class="empty">暂无价格序列，请导入快照。</div>',button('查看信号',`setAsset('${selected}','backtest')`))}${panel('趋势检查',`<div class="panel-body">${[['价格 / MA10',m?num(m.price,3)+' / '+num(m.ma10,3):'—'],['MA20 / MA60',m?num(m.ma20,3)+' / '+num(m.ma60,3):'—'],['20日年化波动',change(m?.vol20)],['数据状态',obs(selected)?.completed?'声明为完整收盘':'缺失或盘中']].map(([n,v])=>`<div class="definition-row"><span>${n}</span><strong class="num">${v}</strong></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="panel-note">上涨家数、跌停家数与全市场宽度待接入。六ETF属于宽基/风格观察。</div>`)}</div>`}`}
function externalMarket(){return `<div class="grid-two">${OVERSEAS.map(([name,t,desc])=>panel(name,`<div class="panel-body">${pill('尚未接入行情/事件')}<h3 style="margin-top:14px">${t}</h3><p class="muted small" style="margin:10px 0 18px">${desc}</p><div class="definition-row"><span>读数 / 时间</span><strong>— / 待补齐</strong></div></div>`)).join('')}</div>${panel('产业链验证清单',`<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>链路</th><th>观察证据</th><th>自选映射</th><th>需反向核实</th></tr></thead><tbody>${[['AI互联','资本开支、迭代、订单与交付','光迅科技 / 长飞光纤','客户、产品和收入暴露'],['存储周期','DRAM价格、库存与供给','长鑫科技','涨价能否覆盖折旧与扩产'],['制造周期','利用率、晶圆价格与资本开支','中芯国际','增长能否带来现金创造'],['市场活跃度','交易活跃与付费产品转化','同花顺','短期热度能否持续'],['材料周期','锂价、库存、成本与回款','天华新能','低基数增长能否持续']].map(r=>`<tr>${r.map(c=>`<td>${c}</td>`).join('')}</tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div>`)}`}
function flowMarket(){return `<div class="grid-two">${panel('资金流：分开四种口径',`<div class="panel-body">${[['大单/主力统计','行情商分类不等于真实机构身份'],['融资净买入','买入减偿还额，非全市场机构资金'],['ETF份额与申赎','份额变化×净值仅为申赎规模估算'],['北向披露','按实际可用频率，不伪造实时净流入']].map(([a,b])=>`<div class="rule-row"><div><strong>${a}</strong><p>${b}</p></div></div>`).join('')}</div>`)}${panel('当前数据覆盖',`<div class="panel-body">${[['价格与成交量',mode==='local'?'新浪/腾讯真实日线':isDemo()?'合成序列':'按导入序列'],['个股资金流',isDemo()?'合成netFlow':'缺失为null'],['ETF资金流','不以股票大单替代申赎'],['机构持仓与融资','尚未接入'],['舆情与盈利预测','尚未接入']].map(([a,b])=>`<div class="definition-row"><span>${a}</span><strong>${b}</strong></div>`).join('')}</div>`)}</div>`}
function filteredStocks(){return WATCH_CODES.map(byCode).filter(a=>(state.filter==='all'||a.type===state.filter)&&(!state.query||[a.name,a.code,a.industry].some(s=>s.includes(state.query))))}
function watchlist(){return title('我的自选','股票与ETF采用不同分析口径；研究范围以你的清单为准。',button('比较多因子',"go('factors')",true,'settings'))+`<div class="toolbar"><div class="filter-tabs">${[['all','全部 8'],['stock','股票 6'],['etf','ETF 2']].map(([id,t])=>`<button class="filter-chip ${state.filter===id?'active':''}" onclick="state.filter='${id}';render()">${t}</button>`).join('')}</div><input placeholder="名称 / 代码 / 行业" aria-label="筛选自选" value="${esc(state.query)}" oninput="state.query=this.value;$('#watch-rows').innerHTML=watchTable(filteredStocks())"></div><section class="panel"><div id="watch-rows">${watchTable(filteredStocks())}</div></section><div style="margin-top:18px">${notice('长鑫科技：688825，上市日2026-07-27；不足一年/两年时不计算长期因子。515980与588080进入ETF成分、估值及份额观察，不与公司财务因子混排。')}</div>`}
